<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (On mobile, modals and bottom sheets should clearly announce themselves to screen readers and temporarily take over the accessibility focus. Users should not be able to navigate to elements behind them while they are open. All controls inside the modal must be properly labeled and reachable through swipe navigation. When the modal or sheet is dismissed, focus should return to a logical point, typically the element or action that opened it, so the experience feels smooth and predictable for assistive technology users.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [1]
>>
